1
00:00:00,200 --> 00:00:02,227
Your smart TV is full of ads.

2
00:00:02,277 --> 00:00:04,850
This free GitHub repo switches them off.

3
00:00:04,900 --> 00:00:07,010
It's called CleanYourTV,

4
00:00:07,010 --> 00:00:09,416
and it was the #1 trending repo on

5
00:00:09,416 --> 00:00:10,850
GitHub this week.

6
00:00:10,900 --> 00:00:13,379
Turn on developer mode on your TV,

7
00:00:13,379 --> 00:00:15,720
then let an AI coding assistant,

8
00:00:15,720 --> 00:00:16,850
like Claude Code,

9
00:00:16,850 --> 00:00:19,350
connect to it over your Wi-Fi.

10
00:00:19,400 --> 00:00:21,351
First, it backs up everything that's

11
00:00:21,351 --> 00:00:22,350
installed.

12
00:00:22,400 --> 00:00:24,730
Then it switches off the ad services,

13
00:00:24,730 --> 00:00:27,498
the tracking, and the sponsored rows.

14
00:00:27,900 --> 00:00:30,090
And you get a clean, black home screen,

15
00:00:30,090 --> 00:00:31,801
with just your apps.

16
00:00:31,900 --> 00:00:34,310
Nothing is deleted, and there's no root,

17
00:00:34,310 --> 00:00:36,850
so one command puts it all back.

18
00:00:36,900 --> 00:00:39,926
It works on Android TV and Google TV.

19
00:00:39,926 --> 00:00:42,350
Not on Samsung or LG.

20
00:00:42,400 --> 00:00:43,550
No laptop?

21
00:00:43,550 --> 00:00:45,443
There's a community app for Android

22
00:00:45,443 --> 00:00:46,688
phones, too.

23
00:00:46,900 --> 00:00:49,991
Comment TV, and I'll send you the link.
